{"id":"word:hebrew:H801","type":"word","title":"אִשָּׁה","subtitle":"H801 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, a burnt-offering ; but occasionally of any sacrifice","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אִשָּׁה (H801) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 65 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אִשָּׁה (ʼishshâh) means properly, a burnt-offering ; but occasionally of any sacrifice First listed occurrence: 1Sam 2 28."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אִשָּׁה","transliteration":"ʼishshâh","pronunciation":"ish-shaw'","strong":"H801","lemmaId":"hebrew:H801","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אִשֶּׁ֖ה","אִשֵּׁ֥ה","אִשֵּׁ֛ה","אִשֶּׁ֥ה","אִשֵּׁ֣י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",31],["HNcmsc",14],["HNcmpc",9],["HR/Ncmpc",7],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp1cs",2],["HC/Ncmsa",1],["HTd/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, a burnt-offering ; but occasionally of any sacrifice","usage":"(offering, sacrifice), (made) by fire.","full":"H801. ishsheh אִשֶּׁה noun masculine Josh 13:14 an offering made by fire (&gt; Wetzst in De Psalmen, ed. 4, 889 derive from √ II. אנשׁ , means to friendly relations between God & man; compare Lag BN 190 ) Exod 29:18 32 t.; construct אִשֵּׁה Lev 1:9 14 t.; plural construct אִשֵּׁי 4:35 15 t.; suffix אִשַּׁי Num 28:2 , אִשָּׁ֑י Lev 6:10 ; used chiefly of offerings of animals, but also of the מִנְחָה 2:11 , and of the sacred bread and frankincense 24:7 , 9 which was placed on the table as a memorial, and finally went to the priests. The word is used in Deut 18:1 ; Josh 13:14 (D) 1Sam 2:28 ; elsewhere in P Lev 6:10 ; 10:15 ; 22:22 ; Num 28:2-3 , especially in phrases יהוה אִשֵּׁי Lev 2:3 11 t., ליהוה נִיחֹחַ רֵיחַ אִשֵּׁה 1:9 14 t., ליהוה אשׁה ניחח ריח Exod 29:18 6 t., ניחח ריח ליהוה אשׁה Lev 23:13 , ניחח לריח אשׁה 3:16 ; Num 18:17 , ליהוה (הוא) אשׁה Exod 29:25 ; Lev 2:16 ; ליהוה אִשֶּׁה accusative after verbs of offering Exod 30:20 14 t., ליהוה עֹלָה אִשֶּׁה Num 28:19 , אִשֶּׁהליהוה קָרְבָּן Lev 22:27 ; Num 15:25 .","rootNote":"the same as 800 , but used in a liturgical sense;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 2 28","keyReferences":["1Sam 2 28","Deut 18 1","Exod 29 18","Exod 29 25","Exod 29 41","Exod 30 20","Josh 13 14","Lev 1 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":65,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 2 28","book":"1Sam","chapter":2,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Deut 18 1","book":"Deut","chapter":18,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֧י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Exod 29 18","book":"Exod","chapter":29,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֶּׁ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 29 25","book":"Exod","chapter":29,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֶּׁ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 29 41","book":"Exod","chapter":29,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֶּׁ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 30 20","book":"Exod","chapter":30,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֶּׁ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Josh 13 14","book":"Josh","chapter":13,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֨י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Lev 1 9","book":"Lev","chapter":1,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Lev 1 13","book":"Lev","chapter":1,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Lev 1 17","book":"Lev","chapter":1,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Lev 2 2","book":"Lev","chapter":2,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אִשֵּׁ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":